claims.canonical_value:
\textbf{Solution:} We have
\[
\left\{
\begin{array}{l}
5k+b=0 \\
k+b=4
\end{array}
\right.
\]
Solving gives
\[
\left\{
\begin{array}{l}
k=-1 \\
b=5
\end{array}
\right.
\]
Thus, the equation of $y_{1}$ is $y_{1}=-x+5$. Setting $y_{2}=0$ in $y_{2}=2x-4$, we get $2x-4=0$, hence $x=2$, so the coordinates of point $D$ are $\boxed{(2,0)}$.

